  "summary": "The experiment tested an RNA-only multiprofile model using pca_n2000 encoder with avgpool aggregation, directly comparing it to scvi_n200 with avgpool (config_003). Validation accuracy of 0.590664 is lower than scvi_n200's 0.650124, suggesting the encoder choice may influence performance. However, the role of aggregation method and other design choices remains uncertain without direct comparison to scvi_n200 with identical configurations."
